    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾱκ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωκέω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθάκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					239
				</span></i>
			: 
				Dor.
			
			fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωκησῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					99.1
				</span></i>
			:—<i>sit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν θρόνῳ θωκέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.173
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωκεῖτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sophr.
					60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνωτέρω θακῶν . . Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					315
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥσυχος θακεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					325
				</span></i>
			&lt;*&gt; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόραι
			θάκουν</span> (impf.) . . <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾔνουν τε</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάκους . . ᾔνουν</span>, om. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τε</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1153
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θακοῦντι παγκρατεῖς
				ἕδρας</span>
			<i>sitting on</i> imperial throne, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				391
			</span></i>; of suppliants, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1173
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βώμιος θακεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					239
				</span></i>
			.</div>
